{
  "watching": {
    "start": "01:01:46,390",
    "end": "01:10:13,931"
  },
  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "01:01:46,390",
      "end": "01:01:48,826",
      "text": "Your songs will bring you back."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:48,860",
      "end": "01:01:51,063",
      "text": "You can. You can reconnect with..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:51,096",
      "end": "01:01:52,697",
      "text": "No, I can't!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:52,730",
      "end": "01:01:57,368",
      "text": "I haven't even heard one of my songs in over 15 years."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:57,401",
      "end": "01:01:59,437",
      "text": "And for good reason."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:02,707",
      "end": "01:02:06,444",
      "text": "Ruby was everything."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:07,678",
      "end": "01:02:11,649",
      "text": "And I don't like honey in my tea."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:14,452",
      "end": "01:02:16,721",
      "text": "He's not gonna change his mind."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:16,754",
      "end": "01:02:18,090",
      "text": "He will."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:18,123",
      "end": "01:02:19,991",
      "text": "But you should go back."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:20,024",
      "end": "01:02:22,293",
      "text": "Me? What about you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:22,927",
      "end": "01:02:25,797",
      "text": "I just need time with him."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:26,664",
      "end": "01:02:29,433",
      "text": "I can't just leave him like this."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:31,536",
      "end": "01:02:33,604",
      "text": "Ten-hut!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:33,638",
      "end": "01:02:36,374",
      "text": "- Whoa. - Welcome back, Mr. Moon, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:36,407",
      "end": "01:02:38,009",
      "text": "Uh, thank you, Miss Crawly."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:38,042",
      "end": "01:02:39,944",
      "text": "Oh, and I have something for you."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:39,977",
      "end": "01:02:41,479",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Moon, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:41,512",
      "end": "01:02:43,781",
      "text": "All right, you can ease off the attitude now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:43,815",
      "end": "01:02:45,550",
      "text": "Oh, oh, yes, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:45,583",
      "end": "01:02:47,618",
      "text": "So, any luck with Clay Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:47,652",
      "end": "01:02:48,686",
      "text": "Shh! Not yet."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:48,719",
      "end": "01:02:50,955",
      "text": "But if anyone can convince him, it's Ash, so..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:50,988",
      "end": "01:02:53,791",
      "text": "All right, folks, tomorrow, we have our first run-through,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:53,825",
      "end": "01:02:56,828",
      "text": "so let's get this show in shipshape shape."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:39,971",
      "end": "01:03:42,506",
      "text": "And cue Porsha."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:47,912",
      "end": "01:03:49,914",
      "text": "Captain's log."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:49,947",
      "end": "01:03:51,482",
      "text": "I must take care,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:51,515",
      "end": "01:03:55,786",
      "text": "for I have landed on the Planet of War."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:55,820",
      "end": "01:03:59,423",
      "text": "Ooh. Okay, so let's just hold it right there, folks."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:59,457",
      "end": "01:04:01,126",
      "text": "Uh, everyone, take five."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:02,593",
      "end": "01:04:05,596",
      "text": "What the heck is a captain's log, anyway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:05,630",
      "end": "01:04:09,134",
      "text": "Um, Porsha, can I have a word?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:09,167",
      "end": "01:04:12,170",
      "text": "Porsha, you know I truly believe"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:12,204",
      "end": "01:04:13,905",
      "text": "that this show, i-it..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:13,938",
      "end": "01:04:16,908",
      "text": "it's close to being fantastic, maybe even perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:16,941",
      "end": "01:04:18,776",
      "text": "- Thank you. - Y-Yeah, yeah,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:18,809",
      "end": "01:04:21,179",
      "text": "but-but, see, to make it the best it can be..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:22,813",
      "end": "01:04:25,650",
      "text": "...well, I got to make some changes."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:25,683",
      "end": "01:04:27,219",
      "text": "Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:27,252",
      "end": "01:04:28,819",
      "text": "Like..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:28,853",
      "end": "01:04:30,655",
      "text": "uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:30,688",
      "end": "01:04:33,058",
      "text": "I have to give the lead role back to Rosita."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:33,091",
      "end": "01:04:34,525",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:34,558",
      "end": "01:04:35,793",
      "text": "I'm just offering you the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:35,826",
      "end": "01:04:38,130",
      "text": "- to switch roles with... - You're firing me?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:38,163",
      "end": "01:04:39,697",
      "text": "No, I-I'm not firing you."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:39,730",
      "end": "01:04:42,200",
      "text": "Oh, wait till my dad hears that you fired me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:42,234",
      "end": "01:04:44,602",
      "text": "But I'm not firing you. Please, wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:44,635",
      "end": "01:04:47,139",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:47,172",
      "end": "01:04:49,207",
      "text": "You all hate me, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:49,241",
      "end": "01:04:52,177",
      "text": "No, no, no, we don't hate you. We all think you're terrific!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:52,210",
      "end": "01:04:53,945",
      "text": "Well, I don't care if you hate me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:53,978",
      "end": "01:04:55,213",
      "text": "Please stop."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:55,247",
      "end": "01:04:58,083",
      "text": "You and your stupid, stupid sky-fi show"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:58,116",
      "end": "01:04:59,817",
      "text": "can go to heck!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:59,850",
      "end": "01:05:01,953",
      "text": "Porsha, stop. Wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:03,587",
      "end": "01:05:06,590",
      "text": "Oh, I am one dead koala."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:24,209",
      "end": "01:05:27,112",
      "text": "♪ I'm not afraid ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:27,145",
      "end": "01:05:30,148",
      "text": "♪ Of anything in this world ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:30,182",
      "end": "01:05:33,251",
      "text": "♪ There's nothing you can throw at me ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:33,285",
      "end": "01:05:36,721",
      "text": "♪ That I haven't already heard ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:36,754",
      "end": "01:05:39,991",
      "text": "♪ I'm just trying to find ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:40,024",
      "end": "01:05:42,994",
      "text": "♪ A decent melody ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:43,027",
      "end": "01:05:46,298",
      "text": "♪ A song that I can sing ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:46,331",
      "end": "01:05:49,600",
      "text": "♪ In my own company ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:51,169",
      "end": "01:05:54,805",
      "text": "♪ I never thought you were a fool ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:05:57,309",
      "end": "01:06:02,546",
      "text": "♪ But, darling, look at you, ooh ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:03,781",
      "end": "01:06:07,152",
      "text": "♪ You gotta stand up straight ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:07,185",
      "end": "01:06:10,021",
      "text": "♪ And carry your own weight ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:10,055",
      "end": "01:06:15,060",
      "text": "♪ These tears are going nowhere, babe ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:16,328",
      "end": "01:06:20,898",
      "text": "♪ You've got to get yourself together ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:20,931",
      "end": "01:06:24,568",
      "text": "♪ You've got stuck in a moment ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:24,602",
      "end": "01:06:28,206",
      "text": "♪ Now you can't get out of it ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:41,319",
      "end": "01:06:45,756",
      "text": "♪ Oh, love, look at you now ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:45,790",
      "end": "01:06:49,727",
      "text": "♪ You got yourself stuck in a moment ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:06:49,760",
      "end": "01:06:53,864",
      "text": "♪ And you can't get out of it. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:05,110",
      "end": "01:07:06,677",
      "text": "♪ Hot News. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:06,710",
      "end": "01:07:09,081",
      "text": "And the hottest story today:"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:09,114",
      "end": "01:07:13,617",
      "text": "Porsha Crystal was reportedly fired from her father's show."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:15,052",
      "end": "01:07:18,156",
      "text": "He fired my daughter?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:18,190",
      "end": "01:07:20,058",
      "text": "My daughter?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:20,092",
      "end": "01:07:22,626",
      "text": "Would you be quiet? You've embarrassed me enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:22,660",
      "end": "01:07:23,828",
      "text": "But, Daddy..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:23,861",
      "end": "01:07:25,263",
      "text": "Now the whole world thinks I got"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:25,297",
      "end": "01:07:27,099",
      "text": "a talentless loser for a daughter."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:27,132",
      "end": "01:07:29,033",
      "text": "Take her home."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:30,102",
      "end": "01:07:32,703",
      "text": "Bring me Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:40,345",
      "end": "01:07:44,249",
      "text": "♪ He will not always say ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:44,282",
      "end": "01:07:49,354",
      "text": "♪ What you would have him say ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:49,387",
      "end": "01:07:54,226",
      "text": "♪ But now and then, he'll say ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:54,259",
      "end": "01:07:59,930",
      "text": "♪ Something wonderful... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:07,305",
      "end": "01:08:09,441",
      "text": "Ash? Now is not a good..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:09,474",
      "end": "01:08:11,276",
      "text": "Moon, I've got him!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:11,309",
      "end": "01:08:13,145",
      "text": "- What? - I got Calloway!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:13,178",
      "end": "01:08:15,113",
      "text": "Here, he wants to talk to you."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:15,147",
      "end": "01:08:18,283",
      "text": "Your friend is even more annoying than you are."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:18,316",
      "end": "01:08:19,884",
      "text": "Don't listen to him."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:19,917",
      "end": "01:08:22,019",
      "text": "We're heading to Redshore right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:22,052",
      "end": "01:08:23,020",
      "text": "- You are? - Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:23,053",
      "end": "01:08:23,854",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:23,888",
      "end": "01:08:25,723",
      "text": "Okay, this is great news, seriously."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:25,756",
      "end": "01:08:27,292",
      "text": "You may have just saved my life here."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:34,432",
      "end": "01:08:36,134",
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:36,168",
      "end": "01:08:37,435",
      "text": "Here we go."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:37,469",
      "end": "01:08:39,737",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, what have you done?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:39,770",
      "end": "01:08:42,107",
      "text": "Mr. Crystal. Aah! I got some great news."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:42,140",
      "end": "01:08:45,210",
      "text": "Clay Calloway is on his way here right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:45,243",
      "end": "01:08:46,944",
      "text": "Everybody, out."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:48,079",
      "end": "01:08:51,082",
      "text": "Okay, I think I know what this might be about, and I..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:51,116",
      "end": "01:08:52,384",
      "text": "You fired Porsha."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:52,417",
      "end": "01:08:54,386",
      "text": "No. No. I never fired her."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:54,419",
      "end": "01:08:56,053",
      "text": "You calling her a liar?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:56,087",
      "end": "01:08:58,889",
      "text": "No, no, no, no, she just got it wrong, is all."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:58,923",
      "end": "01:09:01,059",
      "text": "I was only trying to help her do the best she could,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:01,092",
      "end": "01:09:04,795",
      "text": "and be-believe me, I-I-I just wanted to do the right thing."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:04,828",
      "end": "01:09:07,065",
      "text": "The right thing to do..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:07,098",
      "end": "01:09:09,201",
      "text": "- ...is what I tell you to do! - But I did!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:09,234",
      "end": "01:09:11,436",
      "text": "I-I-I delivered a great show."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:11,469",
      "end": "01:09:13,305",
      "text": "And Ca-Calloway, he's coming."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:13,338",
      "end": "01:09:15,173",
      "text": "No, no, no! Stop! Stop!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:15,207",
      "end": "01:09:16,441",
      "text": "No!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:16,474",
      "end": "01:09:18,343",
      "text": "You really think I'd let a lowlife"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:18,376",
      "end": "01:09:21,346",
      "text": "little amateur loser like you"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:21,379",
      "end": "01:09:22,480",
      "text": "humiliate me?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:22,514",
      "end": "01:09:24,815",
      "text": "Please! Please!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:24,848",
      "end": "01:09:26,484",
      "text": "- You made me look bad. - No, no!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:26,518",
      "end": "01:09:27,818",
      "text": "I didn't mean to!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:27,851",
      "end": "01:09:29,354",
      "text": "No!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:29,387",
      "end": "01:09:31,122",
      "text": "So I'm gonna have to let you go."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:31,156",
      "end": "01:09:33,491",
      "text": "What? Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:33,525",
      "end": "01:09:35,227",
      "text": "Sir. Uh, sir, sir, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:35,260",
      "end": "01:09:37,295",
      "text": "I'm-I'm so sorry, um, so sorry to bother you,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:37,329",
      "end": "01:09:40,098",
      "text": "but, uh, you have a live TV appearance in just a moment,"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:40,131",
      "end": "01:09:41,865",
      "text": "so it-it might be better if we just"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:41,899",
      "end": "01:09:44,269",
      "text": "put a pin in this right now. Um..."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:48,872",
      "end": "01:09:50,808",
      "text": "You-you nearly killed me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:50,841",
      "end": "01:09:52,510",
      "text": "And I'll finish the job later."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:54,145",
      "end": "01:09:55,247",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:56,414",
      "end": "01:09:58,048",
      "text": "No! No!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:58,083",
      "end": "01:09:59,484",
      "text": "Help!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:59,517",
      "end": "01:10:02,254",
      "text": "Help! Jerry! Anyone!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:10:03,887",
      "end": "01:10:07,259",
      "text": "No. Help, please!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:10:07,292",
      "end": "01:10:09,094",
      "text": "Shh!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:10:09,127",
      "end": "01:10:12,197",
      "text": "You need to get out of this city and never, ever come back."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:10:12,230",
      "end": "01:10:13,931",
      "text": "Do you understand? Never."
    }
  ],
  "mimicking": [
    {
      "start": "01:01:46,390",
      "end": "01:01:48,826",
      "text": "Your songs will bring you back."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:01:57,401",
      "end": "01:01:59,437",
      "text": "And for good reason."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:07,678",
      "end": "01:02:11,649",
      "text": "And I don't like honey in my tea."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:18,123",
      "end": "01:02:19,991",
      "text": "But you should go back."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:22,927",
      "end": "01:02:25,797",
      "text": "I just need time with him."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:36,407",
      "end": "01:02:38,009",
      "text": "Uh, thank you, Miss Crawly."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:39,977",
      "end": "01:02:41,479",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Moon, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:02:43,815",
      "end": "01:02:45,550",
      "text": "Oh, oh, yes, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:39,971",
      "end": "01:03:42,506",
      "text": "And cue Porsha."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:03:59,457",
      "end": "01:04:01,126",
      "text": "Uh, everyone, take five."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:05,630",
      "end": "01:04:09,134",
      "text": "Um, Porsha, can I have a word?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:39,730",
      "end": "01:04:42,200",
      "text": "Oh, wait till my dad hears that you fired me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:44,635",
      "end": "01:04:47,139",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:49,241",
      "end": "01:04:52,177",
      "text": "No, no, no, we don't hate you. We all think you're terrific!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:04:59,850",
      "end": "01:05:01,953",
      "text": "Porsha, stop. Wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:09,114",
      "end": "01:07:13,617",
      "text": "Porsha Crystal was reportedly fired from her father's show."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:20,092",
      "end": "01:07:22,626",
      "text": "Would you be quiet? You've embarrassed me enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:07:30,102",
      "end": "01:07:32,703",
      "text": "Bring me Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:13,178",
      "end": "01:08:15,113",
      "text": "Here, he wants to talk to you."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:18,316",
      "end": "01:08:19,884",
      "text": "Don't listen to him."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:25,756",
      "end": "01:08:27,292",
      "text": "You may have just saved my life here."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:37,469",
      "end": "01:08:39,737",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, what have you done?"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:42,140",
      "end": "01:08:45,210",
      "text": "Clay Calloway is on his way here right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:52,417",
      "end": "01:08:54,386",
      "text": "No. No. I never fired her."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:08:56,087",
      "end": "01:08:58,889",
      "text": "No, no, no, no, she just got it wrong, is all."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:11,469",
      "end": "01:09:13,305",
      "text": "And Ca-Calloway, he's coming."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:29,387",
      "end": "01:09:31,122",
      "text": "So I'm gonna have to let you go."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:48,872",
      "end": "01:09:50,808",
      "text": "You-you nearly killed me."
    },
    {
      "start": "01:09:59,517",
      "end": "01:10:02,254",
      "text": "Help! Jerry! Anyone!"
    },
    {
      "start": "01:10:12,230",
      "end": "01:10:13,931",
      "text": "Do you understand? Never."
    }
